## Quiz Master

### Question Structure

```xiom
enum QuizCategory {
  Science; History; Geography; PopCulture;
}

type Question {
  category: QuizCategory;
  text: Str;
  options: Vec[Str];
  correct_index: Int;
  points: Int;
  difficulty: Int;
}
```

### Building Question Bank

```xiom
fn create_all_questions() -> Vec[Question] {
  let mut bank: Vec[Question] = Vec[Question].new();

  let q1 = Question{ category: QuizCategory.Science, text: "What is H2O?", options: Vec[Str].new(), correct_index: 0, points: 10, difficulty: 1 };
  q1.options.push("Water"); q1.options.push("Hydrogen"); q1.options.push("Oxygen"); q1.options.push("Salt");
  bank.push(q1);

  bank
}
```

### Quiz Session

```xiom
type QuizSession {
  questions: Vec[Question];
  current_index: Int;
  score: Int;
  correct_count: Int;
  wrong_count: Int;
  time_remaining: Int;
  category_scores: Vec<(QuizCategory, Int)>;
}
```

### Running a Question

```xiom
fn ask_question(session: &mut QuizSession, q: &Question) -> Bool {
  io.println(q.text);
  let mut i = 0;
  while i < q.options.len() {
    io.println(q.options.get(i).unwrap());
    i += 1;
  };

  let answer = 0;

  if answer == q.correct_index {
    session.score += q.points;
    session.correct_count += 1;
    return true;
  };

  session.wrong_count += 1;
  false
}
```

### Category Filtering

```xiom
fn filter_by_category(bank: &Vec[Question], cat: QuizCategory) -> Vec[Question] {
  let mut filtered: Vec[Question] = Vec[Question].new();
  let mut i = 0;
  while i < bank.len() {
    let q = bank.get(i).unwrap();
    if q.category == cat {
      filtered.push(q.clone());
    };
    i += 1;
  };
  filtered
}
```

### Results Summary

```xiom
fn print_results(session: &QuizSession) {
  let total = session.correct_count + session.wrong_count;
  let pct = if total > 0 { session.correct_count * 100 / total } else { 0 };
  let grade = if pct >= 90 { "A" } else if pct >= 80 { "B" } else if pct >= 70 { "C" } else if pct >= 60 { "D" } else { "F" };

  io.println(session.score);
  io.println(session.correct_count);
  io.println(grade);
}
```

